flowchart TB
    accTitle: Node transport lifecycle
    accDescr: Construct and validate without binding, take event receivers, start listener, then handle data and control work. Shutdown is explicit and owned.
    Build["Construct and validate Node<br/>Optional bootstrap service"]
    Receivers["Take event and control receivers<br/>Before starting consumers"]
    Listen["Bind and start listener<br/>Returns actual socket address"]
    Data["Data connections<br/>Inbound and outbound admission"]
    Control["One-shot control / bootstrap<br/>Separate from active data peers"]
    Build --> Receivers
    Receivers --> Listen
    Listen -->|"Running"| Data
    Listen -->|"Running"| Control
